<% title = 'FAQ - CareCloud – Digital Charity Management System' %>

<!-- FAQ Content -->
<div class="container">
    <h2 class="page-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
    <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-question-circle" style="color: #3498db; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> How does the donation process work?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Our donation process is simple and secure. You can choose to donate money or physical items through our platform. For monetary donations, you can select from over 40 currencies and choose your preferred payment method (Stripe, PayPal, Razorpay, Bank Transfer, or UPI). For item donations, simply fill out the form with details about what you're donating, and we'll arrange for pickup or you can drop it off at our center.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #27ae60; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> Is my donation secure?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Yes, absolutely. We use bank-level security with 256-bit SSL encryption for all transactions. Your payment information is tokenized and never stored on our servers. We're PCI DSS compliant and follow all industry standards for payment security. Your personal information is protected with advanced encryption and secure data handling practices.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-globe" style="color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> What currencies do you accept?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>We support over 40 currencies including USD, EUR, GBP, INR, JPY, CAD, AUD, and many more. Our system automatically handles currency conversion so you can donate in your local currency. The exchange rates are updated in real-time to ensure accurate processing of your donations.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd" style="color: #f39c12; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> Are donations tax-deductible?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Donations may be tax-deductible depending on your location and local tax laws. We provide official donation receipts for all contributions. Please consult with your tax advisor to understand the specific tax benefits available in your jurisdiction. For Indian donors, donations are eligible for tax benefits under Section 80G of the Income Tax Act.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-truck" style="color: #9b59b6; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> How do you ensure donations reach the right people?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>We have a rigorous verification process for all recipient organizations and individuals. Our team personally visits communities to assess needs and verify that donations are distributed appropriately. We maintain detailed records and provide regular updates to donors about how their contributions are making an impact. You can track your donation's journey through our transparent reporting system.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-recycle" style="color: #16a085; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> What happens to items I donate?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Donated items are carefully sorted, cleaned, and distributed to communities in need. Books go to schools and libraries, clothing is distributed to families, and food items are shared with local shelters. We partner with verified organizations to ensure items reach those who need them most. You can view our impact reports to see how your donations are being used.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-user-friends" style="color: #d35400; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> Can I volunteer with CareCloud?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Yes! We're always looking for passionate volunteers to help with various activities including sorting donations, community outreach, and administrative support. You can sign up through our volunteer portal or contact us directly. Volunteering is a great way to make an even bigger impact in your community.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-sync-alt" style="color: #8e44ad; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> How can I track my donation?</h3>
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down toggle-icon"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>After making a donation, you'll receive a confirmation email with a unique tracking ID. You can log into your account to view your donation history and impact reports. We send regular updates about how your contribution is being used, and you can also view success stories and community impact data on our website.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Contact Information Section -->
    <div class="card" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-headset" style="color: #3498db; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> Still Have Questions?</h3>
        <p>Our team is here to help you with any questions about donations, our platform, or how to get involved.</p>
        
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
                <i class="fas fa-envelope" style="color: #e74c3c; font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Email Support</h4>
                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #666;">carecloud505@gmail.com</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
                <i class="fas fa-phone" style="color: #27ae60; font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Phone Support</h4>
                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #666;">+91 9823783450</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
                <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt" style="color: #3498db; font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Visit Us</h4>
                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #666;">Vijayanagar Park Road, Hassan</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
            <a href="/suggest" class="btn"><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i> Send Us a Message</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    // FAQ toggle functionality
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(question => {
        question.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const faqItem = question.parentElement;
            const answer = faqItem.querySelector('.faq-answer');
            const icon = question.querySelector('.toggle-icon');
            
            // Close all other FAQ items
            document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
                if(item !== faqItem) {
                    item.classList.remove('active');
                    item.querySelector('.faq-answer').style.display = 'none';
                    item.querySelector('.toggle-icon').classList.remove('fa-chevron-up');
                    item.querySelector('.toggle-icon').classList.add('fa-chevron-down');
                }
            });
            
            // Toggle current item
            faqItem.classList.toggle('active');
            if(faqItem.classList.contains('active')) {
                answer.style.display = 'block';
                icon.classList.remove('fa-chevron-down');
                icon.classList.add('fa-chevron-up');
            } else {
                answer.style.display = 'none';
                icon.classList.remove('fa-chevron-up');
                icon.classList.add('fa-chevron-down');
            }
        });
    });
</script>